DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8913::$$$message_0065_0000_0000$$$::So today's club is the track and field club.[lr]::
8914::$$$message_0065_0000_0001$$$::I didn't have any relation to the sports ground when I was in the kyudo club, so I don't really know how they're using it...::
8915::$$$message_0065_0001_0000$$$::"Was the track club practice always this intense...?"[lr]::
8916::$$$message_0065_0001_0001$$$::The first-years cry out while they run like lemmings.[lr]::
8917::$$$message_0065_0001_0002$$$::The carnivorous beast chasing them off is...::
8918::$$$message_0065_0002_0000$$$::"Come on, run six more 400s! Run, run, run, die!!![lr]::
8919::$$$message_0065_0002_0001$$$::You there, if you're going to get behind, knock the one in front of you down! You should know that loss is the same as death to a sprinter!"[lr]::
8920::$$$message_0065_0002_0002$$$::...the self-proclaimed black panther; the girl that was born just to run, Kaede Makidera.::
8921::$$$message_0065_0003_0000$$$::"...Wow. Makidera is really enthusiastic when it comes to her club."[lr]::
8922::$$$message_0065_0003_0001$$$::That aside, doesn't knocking down the runner in front of you also mean death as a sprinter too?::
8923::$$$message_0065_0004_0000$$$::"Oh, it's you, Emiya.[lr]::
8924::$$$message_0065_0004_0001$$$::Are you here to watch?"[lr]::
8925::$$$message_0065_0004_0002$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
8926::$$$message_0065_0004_0003$$$::When I turn around, I see Himuro standing there.[lr]::
8927::$$$message_0065_0004_0004$$$::Himuro is a high jump athlete, so she must not be in the sprinter group.::
8928::$$$message_0065_0005_0000$$$::"Yo, just visiting.[lr]::
8929::$$$message_0065_0005_0001$$$::I was just passing by, but before I knew it, I ended up watching."[lr]::
8930::$$$message_0065_0005_0002$$$::"I'm glad you came to watch, but there's nothing fun to wa[line len=2][cacheimage storage=氷室ジャージ01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 time=1500 pos=l accel=0 storage=氷室ジャージ01b(中)][move textoff=0 time=600 path=(660,120,255)(640,120,255)(620,120,255)(600,120,255)(580,120,255)(560,120,255)(540,120,255)(520,120,255) storage=蒔寺ジャージ01e(遠) accel=0][move textoff=0 time=800 path=(-20,54,187)(0,54,187)(20,54,187)(40,54,187)(60,54,187)(80,54,187) storage=氷室ジャージ01a(近) accel=0]actually, it is pretty funny. She's an amusing girl to watch from the sidelines."[lr]::
8931::$$$message_0065_0005_0003$$$::Totally.[lr]::
8932::$$$message_0065_0005_0004$$$::Our hearts are one under the black panther.::
8933::$$$message_0065_0006_0000$$$::"...But, Makidera aside...[lr]::
8934::$$$message_0065_0006_0001$$$::Are you not going to run, Himuro? You still do training runs for high jumps, right?"[lr]::
8935::$$$message_0065_0006_0002$$$::"I finished a light run. I'm in my adjusting period, so I don't really run as much during this time."[lr]::
8936::$$$message_0065_0006_0003$$$::"I see. But, they're practicing a crazy amount over there. The first years look like they're going to die... Is Makidera that strict?"::
8937::$$$message_0065_0007_0000$$$::The first years that finished running the track look like they're about to pass out. They're jogging right now, but their steps are wobbly and uncertain.[lr]::
8938::$$$message_0065_0007_0001$$$::...Yet, Makidera in the back is threatening the first-years that they haven't trained enough, having them go round and round.::
8939::$$$message_0065_0008_0000$$$::"That's what interval training is like. It's meaningless if they don't make it under sixty seconds.[lr]::
8940::$$$message_0065_0008_0001$$$::Most of all, Makidera has a 'do-or-die' spirit. That's her hidden agenda: pushing the first-years to their limits and driving them to despair, which is her guiding principle."::
8941::$$$message_0065_0009_0000$$$::"Geez. That's more sadistic than strict."[lr]::
8942::$$$message_0065_0009_0001$$$::No wonder she throws hands before words.[lr]::
8943::$$$message_0065_0009_0002$$$::That wild animal fundamentally likes to use violence...!::
8944::$$$message_0065_0010_0000$$$::"I feel bad for the first-years this year.[lr]::
8945::$$$message_0065_0010_0001$$$::I would've complained from something like that."[lr]::
8946::$$$message_0065_0010_0002$$$::"That's not true.[lr]::
8947::$$$message_0065_0010_0003$$$::I can't guarantee that you could maintain your speed, but that amount of exercise can't wear you down."::
8948::$$$message_0065_0011_0000$$$::I don't know what she's basing that conclusion off of, but Himuro casually appraises my stamina.[lr]::
8949::$$$message_0065_0011_0001$$$::...Kane Himuro, who is an ordinary person but not ordinary and has a personality that has more to it than meets the eye, suddenly...::
8950::$$$message_0065_0012_0000$$$::"So, about earlier.[lr]::
8951::$$$message_0065_0012_0001$$$::Makidera is not sadistic, but rather, I think she's masochistic."[lr]::
8952::$$$message_0065_0012_0002$$$::"Guh...!"[lr]::
8953::$$$message_0065_0012_0003$$$::I-I'm the one whose tongue slipped, but what is this person saying out of nowhere...!?::
8954::$$$message_0065_0013_0000$$$::"Huh? Is Maki a pervert?"[lr]::
8955::$$$message_0065_0013_0001$$$::Passing by with bad timing is Yukika Saegusa, the manager, unable to hide her surprise at her friend's secret.[lr]::
8956::$$$message_0065_0013_0002$$$::"I think she considerably has that vibe...[cacheimage storage=氷室ジャージ01d(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=氷室ジャージ01d(近) textoff=0]good work, Yukika."::
8957::$$$message_0065_0014_0000$$$::"Saegusa-senpai!"[lr]::
8958::$$$message_0065_0014_0001$$$::"Oh, yes! Sorry, I'll be right there!"[lr]::
8959::$$$message_0065_0014_0002$$$::Saegusa crosses the track while carrying a basket full of water bottles.::
8960::$$$message_0065_0015_0000$$$::"Wait. I'll help out too."[lr]::
8961::$$$message_0065_0015_0001$$$::"Me too..."[lr]::
8962::$$$message_0065_0015_0002$$$::"Oh, it's fine, Emiya, [cacheimage storage=由紀香ジャージ01a(遠)][wvl][chgfg storage=由紀香ジャージ01a(遠) time=300 textoff=0]this is nothing."::
8963::$$$message_0065_0016_0000$$$::...Oh. Well, Himuro is with her, so I guess it's fine.[lr]::
8964::$$$message_0065_0016_0001$$$::Besides, the track members would also get surprised if an outsider brought them water bottles.::
8965::$$$message_0065_0017_0000$$$::"All right everyone, get some water! It's easy to cut corners during this time, so be careful, rookies![lr]::
8966::$$$message_0065_0017_0001$$$::And once you finish your lunch, we have a meeting so meet at 1A! And for every second you're late, you'll be making up in sprinting time!"[lr]::
8967::$$$message_0065_0017_0002$$$::"M-Ma'am...! Yes, ma'am...!"::
8968::$$$message_0065_0018_0000$$$::The first-years, who repeated sprinting and jogging over and over again, cry as they leave.[lr]::
8969::$$$message_0065_0018_0001$$$::...She's relentless. If you did that much, you'd build stamina, whether you liked it or not.::
8970::$$$message_0065_0019_0000$$$::"Good work, Maki, here."[lr]::
8971::$$$message_0065_0019_0001$$$::"Thanks, you always work hard, Yukicchi. Himuro, how's your adjustment?"[lr]::
8972::$$$message_0065_0019_0002$$$::"Not bad."[lr]::
8973::$$$message_0065_0019_0003$$$::She jogs lightly with a water bottle in one hand, and passes by in front of me.[lr]::
8974::$$$message_0065_0019_0004$$$::Her gaze crosses over me. I wonder if she thinks a rare visitor is here.::
8975::$$$message_0065_0020_0000$$$::"Oh, it's Emiya. What are you doing?"[lr]::
8976::$$$message_0065_0020_0001$$$::"I'm watching as you can tell."[lr]::
8977::$$$message_0065_0020_0002$$$::"You've got a lot of time on your hands."[lr]::
8978::$$$message_0065_0020_0003$$$::For real.[lr]::
8979::$$$message_0065_0020_0004$$$::What was supposed to be a patrol for the sake of looking for abnormalities in the town has become a stroll to find the good things in the town.[lr]::
8980::$$$message_0065_0020_0005$$$::...This is also because I couldn't find any abnormalities at all.::
8981::$$$message_0065_0021_0000$$$::"Hmm. Hey, how about you actually help our club out instead of just standing there twiddling your thumbs?"[lr]::
8982::$$$message_0065_0021_0001$$$::"...Mrgh. Did you break something again?"[lr]::
8983::$$$message_0065_0021_0002$$$::"No. I just messed the starting pistol up."[lr]::
8984::$$$message_0065_0021_0003$$$::...That's what you call break, but leaving that aside...::
8985::$$$message_0065_0022_0000$$$::"Is there anything other than that starting pistol?"[lr]::
8986::$$$message_0065_0022_0001$$$::"Yeah. There's a lot of hurdles that are hard to adjust now.[lr]::
8987::$$$message_0065_0022_0002$$$::You can fix it right away, right? I'll compensate you based on negotiation, so think about it."[lr]::
8988::$$$message_0065_0022_0003$$$::"Sure. That's a piece of cake."::
8989::$$$message_0065_0023_0000$$$::"That was fast! And cheap![lr]::
8990::$$$message_0065_0023_0001$$$::Wow, you accepted that super easily. I can't really trust that part of you."[lr]::
8991::$$$message_0065_0023_0002$$$::"Hm? Then should I decline?"[lr]::
8992::$$$message_0065_0023_0003$$$::"...No. If you'll do it for me, do it.[lr]::
8993::$$$message_0065_0023_0004$$$::It's fine, it's convenient."::
8994::$$$message_0065_0024_0000$$$::"That helps, Emiya. I shall thank you on behalf of Kaede who won't thank you."[lr]::
8995::$$$message_0065_0024_0001$$$::"Oh, since we'll be indebted to you... [cacheimage storage=由紀香ジャージ01a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=由紀香ジャージ01a(中) time=300]Would you like to join us for lunch?"::
8996::$$$message_0065_0025_0000$$$::"What!? Why are you inviting him, Yukicchi!? You don't have to do that! Emiya is saying he'll do it for free![lr]::
8997::$$$message_0065_0025_0001$$$::Look, his kind is called the 'loves community service tribe', and he dies if you're considerate to him!"[lr]::
8998::$$$message_0065_0025_0002$$$::[line len=2]What kind of creature is that?[line len=2]::
8999::$$$message_0065_0026_0000$$$::"B-But... Wouldn't it be bad...to ask him to do such a thing?"[lr]::
9000::$$$message_0065_0026_0001$$$::"It's up to Emiya.[lr]::
9001::$$$message_0065_0026_0002$$$::Although it doesn't look like he has any lunch on hand."[lr]::
9002::$$$message_0065_0026_0003$$$::"Yeah, I was going to go somewhere to eat."[lr]::
9003::$$$message_0065_0026_0004$$$::Saegusa's face lights up.[lr]::
9004::$$$message_0065_0026_0005$$$::I can't find any reason to decline if she makes a face like that.::
9005::$$$message_0065_0027_0000$$$::"Um, there was lunch for all the members, but there's some missing members and we have extra now.[lr]::
9006::$$$message_0065_0027_0001$$$::Emiya, will you help us eat it?"::
9007::$$$message_0065_0028_0000$$$::"...Okay. If that's the case, then I'll have some, thanks."[lr]::
9008::$$$message_0065_0028_0001$$$::I can also think of this as my compensation.[lr]::
9009::$$$message_0065_0028_0002$$$::If I get treated to lunch, then my motivation to repair the hurdles will also go up.::
9010::$$$message_0065_0029_0000$$$::"I said there's no need to make Emiya eat it, ugh."[lr]::
9011::$$$message_0065_0029_0001$$$::"...I bet you'd be able to eat two servings for lunch and three servings for dinner and be totally fine, Makino-G."[lr]::
9012::$$$message_0065_0029_0002$$$::"I wouldn't be fine! What am I, some kind of monster[cacheimage storage=由紀香ジャージ01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=由紀香ジャージ01b(中) textoff=0]!?"[lr]::
9013::$$$message_0065_0029_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
9014::$$$message_0065_0029_0004$$$::I swallow the truth that, while I can't imagine her actually eating that much, there are competitive eaters in the West who probably could.::
9015::$$$message_0065_0030_0000$$$::"Let's eat!"[lr]::
9016::$$$message_0065_0030_0001$$$::Lunch begins.[lr]::
9017::$$$message_0065_0030_0002$$$::There must be no afternoon practice, as the three of them change before eating.::
9018::$$$message_0065_0031_0000$$$::Inside the aluminum foil are sandwiches of marinated salmon in a thick baguette.[lr]::
9019::$$$message_0065_0031_0001$$$::They said lunch, so I was expecting rice with colorful side dishes, but the content was rather light.[lr]::
9020::$$$message_0065_0031_0002$$$::It's true that you can't eat fried things after exercising that intensely. It's a well-thought-out lunch, just what you'd expect from a manager.::
9021::$$$message_0065_0032_0000$$$::"Is it too plain?"[lr]::
9022::$$$message_0065_0032_0001$$$::"Of course not, thank you... [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 storage=蒔寺制服03a(近) pos=r time=300]But from what I hear, apparently Emiya's a foodie."[cacheimage storage=由紀香制服02c(近)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服02c(近) textoff=0][lr]::
9023::$$$message_0065_0032_0002$$$::"Mhm. There's a rumor that Lady Matou brings him a multi-tiered lunch box once every two days."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
9024::$$$message_0065_0032_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01d(近) textoff=0]Since when has such a rumor started going around?[lr]::
9025::$$$message_0065_0032_0004$$$::Even though this is about myself, it sounds like quite a privileged lunch situation hearing it from other people.::
9026::$$$message_0065_0033_0000$$$::"In a multi-tiered lunch box? Wow, Miss Matou is impressive. I wouldn't be able to make that much."[lr]::
9027::$$$message_0065_0033_0001$$$::"That's why he has a discerning palate, and if I remember correctly, Emiya also cooks too, right?[lr]::
9028::$$$message_0065_0033_0002$$$::Watch out, Yukika, depending on the lunch, he might come to call for you as a hostess!"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
9029::$$$message_0065_0033_0003$$$::"...What kind of gourmet scholar is that, Makino-G?"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
9030::$$$message_0065_0034_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9031::$$$message_0065_0034_0001$$$::...Geez. If I'm privileged, then the track club is also privileged.[lr]::
9032::$$$message_0065_0034_0002$$$::How could there be any complaints with this lunch?[lr]::
9033::$$$message_0065_0034_0003$$$::Saegusa's lunch may be plain, but it's thoughtfully made with the people who will eat it in mind.[lr]::
9034::$$$message_0065_0034_0004$$$::Even for Tohsaka who splurges on things, I'm sure she would be moved by Saegusa's consideration.::
9035::$$$message_0065_0035_0000$$$::"All right. Yukicchi, I'll cheer you on in the ultimate menu showdown.[lr]::
9036::$$$message_0065_0035_0001$$$::It's pretty much a win if you just win Ramsay over!"[lr]::
9037::$$$message_0065_0035_0002$$$::"I'm...ashamed of myself. I can't be of any help when it comes to cooking."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
9038::$$$message_0065_0035_0003$$$::"...Oh, but Emiya will eat it like it's good, so it's okay."::
9039::$$$message_0065_0036_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
9040::$$$message_0065_0036_0001$$$::I look up, hearing my name.[lr]::
9041::$$$message_0065_0036_0002$$$::"Oh, did I have bad manners?"[lr]::
9042::$$$message_0065_0036_0003$$$::"No, that's not it. Yukika is saying she's happy to see you eating with a smile."[lr]::
9043::$$$message_0065_0036_0004$$$::"A smile, huh... Well, naturally, I can't help but smile if I'm eating something good."::
9044::$$$message_0065_0037_0000$$$::"I'm glad. [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01a(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01a(近) textoff=0]Oh, please have some yogurt too."[lr]::
9045::$$$message_0065_0037_0001$$$::"Good thing it lives up to Emiya's standards, Yukika.[lr]::
9046::$$$message_0065_0037_0002$$$::Hm. At this point, I'm more interested in Emiya's lunch than Lady Matou's lunch now."::
9047::$$$message_0065_0038_0000$$$::"Emiya's lunch, huh? But, I've never seen Emiya eating lunch."[lr]::
9048::$$$message_0065_0038_0001$$$::"He's always with Ryudou in the student council room."[lr]::
9049::$$$message_0065_0038_0002$$$::"The meals of temple children have low meat content after all. Therefore, Emiya must be the saving angel for the student council president."::
9050::$$$message_0065_0039_0000$$$::"Ew, what is that metaphor!? What's worse is that it's embarrassing, yet I don't even feel like it's wrong!"[lr]::
9051::$$$message_0065_0039_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
9052::$$$message_0065_0039_0002$$$::It's a bit sad that I can't argue back.[lr]::
9053::$$$message_0065_0039_0003$$$::But, Issei is a growing boy.[lr]::
9054::$$$message_0065_0039_0004$$$::With a lunch of only greens, he'll faint from being out of fuel when having a duel with his mortal enemy, Tohsaka.::
9055::$$$message_0065_0040_0000$$$::"Hm, hm. So, is the lunch that you give Ryudou good? Is it so special that the student council president gets addicted to it? Is it so 'ultimate' that it could compete with Yukicchi's lunch...?"::
9056::$$$message_0065_0041_0000$$$::"I'm aware that the taste is decent. It's usually my leftovers, so it's nothing special.[lr]::
9057::$$$message_0065_0041_0001$$$::Besides, there's no way that a guy's lunch can beat a girl's lunch."[lr]::
9058::$$$message_0065_0041_0002$$$::It's not about how presentable it is, but how the existential value itself is completely different.::
9059::$$$message_0065_0042_0000$$$::"Really? I still think you're special, since boys don't really make their own lunch."[lr]::
9060::$$$message_0065_0042_0001$$$::"Hahaha. I guess when it comes to scarcity value, that's true.[lr]::
9061::$$$message_0065_0042_0002$$$::But if Emiya and Ryudou are the only ones eating it, he's nothing against the track club's idol and very own Yukicchi."::
9062::$$$message_0065_0043_0000$$$::"No. Lady Tohsaka also eats Emiya's lunch.[lr]::
9063::$$$message_0065_0043_0001$$$::I've seen her have Emiya's lunch box in her desk before."[lr]::
9064::$$$message_0065_0043_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 pos=r storage=由紀香制服01d(近) textoff=0]I almost choke on[quake vmax=30 hmax=0 time=400] a piece of my baguette.[se storage=se308.wav][lr]::
9065::$$$message_0065_0043_0003$$$::K-Kane Himuro cannot be underestimated, and Rin Tohsaka isn't careful enough![lr]::
9066::$$$message_0065_0043_0004$$$::I don't mind making her lunch, but I told her to properly hide it!!!::
9067::$$$message_0065_0044_0000$$$::"W-WHATTTTT!!!???[rf][lr]::
9068::$$$message_0065_0044_0001$$$::F-F-Freaking Tohsaka even lets Emiya do that for her!? Just because she likes taking the easy way out, she even has him make lunch for her!?[lr]::
9069::$$$message_0065_0044_0002$$$::It's as if Emiya and Tohsaka are dating!"::
9070::$$$message_0065_0045_0000$$$::"Makino-G. Not just 'as if,' aren't those two actually dating?"[lr]::
9071::$$$message_0065_0045_0001$$$::"What... [cacheimage storage=由紀香制服01f(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香制服01f(近) textoff=0]Wa, wahh..."[lr]::
9072::$$$message_0065_0045_0002$$$::"I won't accept it! There's no way this diligent helper would stick with that cocky and pigheaded girl![lr]::
9073::$$$message_0065_0045_0003$$$::Girls like Tohsaka can't make any friends! Even if she was able to, it's just someone like me who she's totally trying to use!"[lr]::
9074::$$$message_0065_0045_0004$$$::"...However. Regarding the current matter at hand, Lady Tohsaka brings a lunch box with the Emiya symbol twice a week."::
9075::$$$message_0065_0046_0000$$$::"Wahhh! T-Then, she's making Emiya fall for her using her charm! If you ask me it's, um, um... Shoot, what do you call that!?[lr]::
9076::$$$message_0065_0046_0001$$$::Yukicchi!"[lr]::
9077::$$$message_0065_0046_0002$$$::"Huh, me!?[lr]::
9078::$$$message_0065_0046_0003$$$::...Um... I think honey trap...?"::
9079::$$$message_0065_0047_0000$$$::"That's it! She's done it to so many guys that she's lost count![lr]::
9080::$$$message_0065_0047_0001$$$::A-All right... Here, Emiya... I don't want to give it to you, but here's my yogurt.[lr]::
9081::$$$message_0065_0047_0002$$$::Eat it!"[lr]::
9082::$$$message_0065_0047_0003$$$::"That's okay. I got one from Miss Saegusa."::
9083::$$$message_0065_0048_0000$$$::"K-Khhhh! [wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服02b(近) textoff=0]A-Are you saying that you won't waver from my charm!? Come on, it's prunes! It's not that yummy, but eat it, man...!"[lr]::
9084::$$$message_0065_0048_0001$$$::"Maki, you can't pressure him like that."[lr]::
9085::$$$message_0065_0048_0002$$$::"...Yukika. Try to understand Makidera's feelings... How pitiful."::
9086::$$$message_0065_0049_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9087::$$$message_0065_0049_0001$$$::Something must've pushed Makidera's buttons.[lr]::
9088::$$$message_0065_0049_0002$$$::Well, Himuro must be the one who pushed them, but it seems like all the damage will fall onto me.[lr]::
9089::$$$message_0065_0049_0003$$$::...It's time for me to leave soon.[lr]::
9090::$$$message_0065_0049_0004$$$::They treated me to lunch, so I should return the favor soon.::
9091::$$$message_0065_0050_0000$$$::"Well, I'll excuse myself now.[lr]::
9092::$$$message_0065_0050_0001$$$::Thanks, Saegusa. The salmon and bread were both good."[lr]::
9093::$$$message_0065_0050_0002$$$::"You're welcome, it was nothing."[lr]::
9094::$$$message_0065_0050_0003$$$::"...Don't let Makino-G's teasing about Tohsaka bother you, Emiya."[lr]::
9095::$$$message_0065_0050_0004$$$::"K-Khhh! You're an eyesore after all, Emiya!"::
9096::$$$message_0065_0051_0000$$$::...Now, I should roll up my sleeves and get to work.[lr]::
9097::$$$message_0065_0051_0001$$$::I need to go get lubricant spray and grease from the toolbox in the storage room for repairing the hurdles...::
909077::$$$message_9065_0046_0002$$$::"Huh, me!? ...Um... I think honey trap...?"[r]:��%